#: .\www\outils\content\bio.py:17
msgid "Immerse your soul in love"
msgstr "Escribo para que la muerte no tenga la última palabra."

#: .\www\outils\content\bio.py:18
msgid "Radiohead. Street Spirit (Fade Out)"
msgstr "Odysséas Elýtis"

#: .\www\outils\content\bio.py:19
msgid ""
"I'm a Software Engineer graduated from the <a class=\"external-link\" "
"href=\"https://www.udg.mx/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener "
"noreferrer\">University of Guadalajara</a> with extensive experience in web "
"development and recent experience incorporating AI into the SDLC. I'm "
"passionate about traveling, language learning, music, and food."
msgstr ""
"Ingeniero de Software egresado de la <a class=\"external-link\" "
"href=\"https://www.udg.mx/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener "
"noreferrer\">Universidad de Guadalajara</a> con amplia experiencia en  "
"desarrollo web, además de experiencia reciente incorporando IA en el SDLC. "
"Me apasionan los viajes, aprender idiomas, la música y la comida."

#: .\www\outils\content\bio.py:25
msgid ""
"I'm currently working as a Principal Engineer at <a class=\"external-link\" "
"href=\"https://www.altimetrik.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener "
"noreferrer\">Altimetrik</a>, making use of AI for enhancing software "
"development and creating solutions that have a positive impact on people."
msgstr ""
"Actualmente me desempeño como Principal Engineer en <a class=\"external-"
"link\" href=\"https://www.altimetrik.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener "
"noreferrer\">Altimetrik</a>, haciendo uso de la IA para optimizar el "
"desarrollo de software y crear soluciones que impacten positivamente a la "
"gente."

#: .\www\outils\content\bio.py:30
msgid ""
"I improved the lives of many through technology at <a class=\"external-"
"link\" href=\"https://www.micompaseguros.com/\" target=\"_blank\" "
"rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Mi Compa</a>. I worked as a Tech Lead, "
"innovating and providing quality services to the people."
msgstr ""
"Mejoré la vida de mucha gente a través de la tecnología en <a "
"class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.micompaseguros.com/\" "
"target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Mi Compa</a>. Trabajé como "
"Líder Técnico inovando y brindando servicios de calidad a las personas."

#: .\www\outils\content\bio.py:35
msgid ""
"I was part of the amazing team of developers at <span>Anexinet</span>. I "
"worked as a Senior Backend Developer, exploring Serverless technologies to "
"build and deliver robust solutions."
msgstr ""
"Fui parte del asombroso equipo de desarrolladores en <span>Anexinet</span>. "
"Trabajé como Desarrollador Backend Senior, explorando tecnologías Serverless "
"para desarrollar y entregar soluciones robustas."

#: .\www\outils\content\bio.py:38
msgid ""
"I worked as a Full-stack Developer at the <a class=\"external-link\" "
"href=\"https://cgig.jalisco.gob.mx/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener "
"noreferrer\">Innovation Division</a> of the Government of the State of "
"Jalisco. I was part of the department of New Technologies, responsible for "
"creating innovative solutions that keep the State of Jalisco at the leading "
"edge of technology."
msgstr ""
"Trabajé como Desarrollador Fullstack en la <a class=\"external-link\" "
"href=\"https://cgig.jalisco.gob.mx/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener "
"noreferrer\">División de Innovación</a> del Gobierno del Estado de Jalisco. "
"Formé parte del departamento de Nuevas Tecnologías, responsable de crear "
"soluciones innovadoras para mantener la vanguardia tecnológica del Estado de "
"Jalisco."

#: .\www\outils\content\bio.py:45
msgid ""
"I worked as a .NET Developer at <span>Calafia Airlines</span>, helping to "
"build and maintain the main booking system as well as connecting the "
"airline's booking APIs with external brokers like SkyScanner and Expedia."
msgstr ""
"Trabajé como Desarrollador .NET en <span>Calafia Airlines</span>, ayudando a "
"desarrollar y mantener el sistema principal de reservaciones, así como a "
"conectar la API de reservaciones de la aerolínea con brokers externos como "
"SkyScanner y Expedia."

#: .\www\outils\content\bio.py:49
msgid ""
"I was in charge of developing the first version of Cursalia, a MOOC platform "
"written in Python for the University of Guadalajara and <a class=\"external-"
"link\" href=\"https://sapiensmedicus.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener "
"noreferrer\">Sapiens Medicus</a>."
msgstr ""

#: .\www\outils\content\bio.py:54
msgid ""
"I worked as the lead developer of CARES, a project that finished amongst the "
"finalists on the international contest FI-WARE Smart Cities (January 2014) "
"and then won the first place on the international contest FI-WARE Smart "
"Society (October 2014)."
msgstr ""
"Me desempeñé como el líder de desarrollo de CARES, proyecto finalista en la "
"competición internacional \"FI-WARE Smart Cities\" (Enero 2014) y primer "
"lugar en la competición internacional \"FI-WARE Smart Society\" (Octubre "
"2014)."

#: .\www\outils\content\bio.py:58
msgid "Thanks a lot for stopping by! Have a great day!"
msgstr "¡Gracias por tu visita! ¡Que tengas un excelente día!"

#: .\www\outils\content\cv.py:17
msgid ""
"I'm a Software Engineer with over 15 years of experience as a Full Stack "
"Developer. I have extensive experience developing REST APIs, microservices, "
"and Serverless solutions. My work focuses on architecting and developing "
"secure, efficient, and scalable applications using mainly JavaScript and "
"Python, as well as deploying them to cloud providers like AWS and Azure. I "
"recently began incorporating AI throughout the SDLC to boost development "
"speed and improve the quality of the software."
msgstr ""
"Soy un Ingeniero de Software con más de 15 años trabajando como "
"Desarrollador Fullstack. Tengo amplia experiencia desarrollando APIs REST, "
"microservicios, y soluciones Serverless. Mi trabajo se enfoca en definir la "
"arquitectura y desarrollar soluciones seguras, eficientes y escalables "
"utilizando principalmente Python y JavaScript, así como desplegarlas en "
"proveedores de nube como AWS y Azure. Recientemente comencé a incorporar IA "
"en el SDLC para aumentar la velocidad de desarrollo y mejorar la calidad del "
"software."

