#: .\www\outils\content\cv.py:48
msgid ""
"In charge of the tech transition of several stacks from <span class=\"txt-"
"bold\">.NET</span> to <span class=\"txt-bold\">Node.js</span> to help reduce "
"infrastructure costs while improving the performance and scalability of the "
"stacks. Deployed the stacks to <span class=\"txt-bold\">AWS Lambda</span>, "
"<span class=\"txt-bold\">ECS</span>, and <span class=\"txt-bold\">EKS</span> "
"services using <span class=\"txt-bold\">Terraform</span> and <span "
"class=\"txt-bold\">Harness</span>."
msgstr ""
"A cargo de la transición técnica de distintas soluciones desde <span "
"class=\"txt-bold\">.NET</span> hacia <span class=\"txt-bold\">Node.js</span> "
"para ayudar a reducir costos de infraestructura y, en paralelo, mejorar el "
"rendimiento y la escalabilidad de dichas soluciones. Despliegue de las "
"soluciones en <span class=\"txt-bold\">AWS Lambda</span>, <span class=\"txt-"
"bold\">ECS</span>, y <span class=\"txt-bold\">EKS</span> usando <span "
"class=\"txt-bold\">Terraform</span> y class=\"txt-bold\">Harness</span>."

#: .\www\outils\content\cv.py:57
msgid ""
"Contributed to the development of several web components made with <span "
"class=\"txt-bold\">Vanilla JavaScript</span>. The web components helped "
"standardize the UI/UX throughout the website of one of Altimetrik's clients."
msgstr ""
"Contribuí al desarrollo de distintos componentes web hechos con <span "
"class=\"txt-bold\">Vanilla JavaScript</span>. Dichos componentes web "
"ayudaron a estandarizar la interfaz y experiencia del usuario en el sitio "
"web de uno de los clientes de Altimetrik."

#: .\www\outils\content\cv.py:61
msgid ""
"Led the development team to successfuly achieve the technical goals of the "
"company."
msgstr ""
"Dirigí el equipo de desarrolladores para alcanzar los objetivos técnicos de "
"lacompañía."

#: .\www\outils\content\cv.py:63
msgid ""
"Developed a chatbot for converting leads into customers through social "
"channels like Facebook Messenger and WhatsApp. The chatbot helped increase "
"leads conversion by 26%. It was developed using <span class=\"txt-"
"bold\">Node.js</span>, <span class=\"txt-bold\">MySQL</span>, <span "
"class=\"txt-bold\">PostgreSQL</span> and <span class=\"txt-bold\">MongoDB</"
"span>."
msgstr ""
"Desarrollé un chatbot para convertir leads en clientes a través de canales "
"sociales como Facebook Messenger y WhatsApp. El chatbot ayudó a incrementar "
"la conversión de leads en un 26%. Fue desarrollado con <span class=\"txt-"
"bold\">Node.js</span>, <span class=\"txt-bold\">MySQL</span>, <span "
"class=\"txt-bold\">PostgreSQL</span> y <span class=\"txt-bold\">MongoDB</"
"span>."

#: .\www\outils\content\cv.py:70
msgid ""
"Contributed to the development of the company's CRM using <span class=\"txt-"
"bold\">Node.js</span>, <span class=\"txt-bold\">AWS Lambda</span>, <span "
"class=\"txt-bold\">MySQL</span>, <span class=\"txt-bold\">PostgreSQL</span> "
"and <span class=\"txt-bold\">React</span>."
msgstr ""
"Contribuí al desarrollo del CRM de la compañía utilizando <span class=\"txt-"
"bold\">Node.js</span>, <span class=\"txt-bold\">AWS Lambda</span>, <span "
"class=\"txt-bold\">MySQL</span>, <span class=\"txt-bold\">PostgreSQL</span> "
"y <span class=\"txt-bold\">React</span>."

#: .\www\outils\content\cv.py:75
msgid ""
"Developed microservices using <span class=\"txt-bold\">Node.js</span> and "
"<span class=\"txt-bold\">GraphQL</span> and deployed them to <span "
"class=\"txt-bold\">AWS Lambda</span>."
msgstr ""
"Desarrollé microservicios usando  <span class=\"txt-bold\">Node.js</span> y "
"<span class=\"txt-bold\">GraphQL</span> y los desplegué en <span class=\"txt-"
"bold\">AWS Lambda</span>."

#: .\www\outils\content\cv.py:78
msgid ""
"Implemented a <span class=\"txt-bold\">Headless CMS (Webiny)</span> to "
"dynamically serve localized content for a website, improving loading times "
"by nearly 30%."
msgstr ""
"Implementé un <span class=\"txt-bold\">Headless CMS (Webiny)</span> para "
"despachar dinámicamente contenido localizado para un sitio web, optimizando "
"tiempos de carga cerca de un 30%."

#: .\www\outils\content\cv.py:81
msgid ""
"Built web applications using a client-server architecture with <span "
"class=\"txt-bold\">Angular</span> in the front end and <span class=\"txt-"
"bold\">Lumen (PHP)</span> in the back end. Developed backend services with "
"an MVC architecture using <span class=\"txt-bold\">Laravel (PHP)</span> "
"connected to <span class=\"txt-bold\">MySQL</span> and <span class=\"txt-"
"bold\">PostgreSQL</span> databases."
msgstr ""
"Construí aplicaciones web usando arquitectura cliente-servidor con <span "
"class=\"txt-bold\">Angular</span> en el frontend y <span class=\"txt-"
"bold\">Lumen (PHP)</span> en el backend. Desarrollé servicios backend con "
"arquitectura MVC utilizando <span class=\"txt-bold\">Laravel (PHP)</span> "
"conectado a bases de datos <span class=\"txt-bold\">MySQL</span> y <span "
"class=\"txt-bold\">PostgreSQL</span>."

#: .\www\outils\content\cv.py:88
msgid ""
"Developed a backend management system for a Government department using "
"<span class=\"txt-bold\">Django (Python)</span> and <span class=\"txt-"
"bold\">PostgreSQL</span> to help increase productivity by automating several "
"processes of the department."
msgstr ""
"Desarrollé un sistema de gestión para una dependencia del Gobierno usando "
"<span class=\"txt-bold\">Django (Python)</span> y <span class=\"txt-"
"bold\">PostgreSQL</span>, ayudando a incrementar la productividad al "
"automatizar diversos procesos del departamento."

#: .\www\outils\content\cv.py:93
msgid ""
"Collaborated on building a mobile app for a social program using the <span "
"class=\"txt-bold\">Ionic</span> framework."
msgstr ""
"Colaboré en la creación de una app para dispositivos móviles para un "
"programa social usando el framework <span class=\"txt-bold\">Ionic</span>."

#: .\www\outils\content\cv.py:95
msgid ""
"Worked on the REST APIs that constituted the booking engine of the airline "
"using <span class=\"txt-bold\">C#</span>, <span class=\"txt-bold\">ASP.NET "
"MVC</span> and <span class=\"txt-bold\">ASP.NET Core</span>."
msgstr ""
"Trabajé en las APIs REST que constituyeron el motor de reservaciones de la "
"aerolínea usando <span class=\"txt-bold\">C#</span>, <span class=\"txt-"
"bold\">ASP.NET MVC</span> y <span class=\"txt-bold\">ASP.NET Core</span>."

#: .\www\outils\content\cv.py:99
msgid ""
"In charge of the integration of the airline's booking engine with some of "
"the major booking brokers like Expedia, SkyScanner, and Despegar, resulting "
"in a considerable boost on the airline's sales."
msgstr ""
"Encargado de la integración del motor de reservaciones de la aerolínea con "
"algunos de los mayores brokers de reservaciones como Expedia, SkyScanner y "
"Despegar, resultando en un aumento considerable en las vents de la aerolínea."

#: .\www\outils\content\cv.py:103
msgid ""
"Collaborated on configuring and managing virtual servers and cloud services "
"on <span class=\"txt-bold\">Azure</span>."
msgstr ""
"Colaboré en la configuración y el mantenimiento de servidores virtuales y "
"servicios en la nube de <span class=\"txt-bold\">Azure</span>."

#: .\www\outils\content\cv.py:105
msgid ""
"Designed, architected, and developed a MOOC platform based on Open edX. It "
"was built with <span class=\"txt-bold\">Django (Python)</span> and <span "
"class=\"txt-bold\">Flask (Python)</span> and deployed on a private server "
"with <span class=\"txt-bold\">Debian</span> and <span class=\"txt-"
"bold\">Nginx</span>."
msgstr ""
"Diseñé, definí la arquitectura y desarrollé una plataforma MOOC basada en "
"Open edX. Desarrollada con <span class=\"txt-bold\">Django (Python)</span> "
"and <span class=\"txt-bold\">Flask (Python)</span> y desplegada en un "
"servidor privado con <span class=\"txt-bold\">Debian</span> and <span "
"class=\"txt-bold\">Nginx</span>."

#: .\www\outils\content\cv.py:111
msgid ""
"Led the development of CARES, a healthcare project that won the first place "
"on the international contest FI-WARE Smart Society (october 2014) and was "
"amongst the finalists of the internatinoal contest FI-WARE Smart Cities "
"(january 2014)."
msgstr ""
"Dirigí el desarrollo de CARES, un proyecto enfocado en la salud, el cuál "
"ganó el primer lugar en el concurso internacional FI-WARE Smart Society "
"(octubre 2014) y fue finalista en el concurso internacional FI-WARE Smart "
"Cities (enero 2014)."

#: .\www\outils\content\cv.py:115
msgid ""
"Developed web services with <span class=\"txt-bold\">Tornado (Python)</span>."
msgstr ""
"Desarrollé servicios web con <span class=\"txt-bold\">Tornado (Python)</"
"span>."

#: .\www\outils\content\cv.py:117
msgid ""
"Built productivity apps for iOS and Android using <span class=\"txt-"
"bold\">Objective-C</span> and <span class=\"txt-bold\">Java</span>."
msgstr ""
"Desarrollé apps de productividad para iOS y Android usando <span class=\"txt-"
"bold\">Objective-C</span> and <span class=\"txt-bold\">Java</span>."

#: .\www\outils\content\cv.py:120
msgid ""
"Collaborated on the development of videogames for iOS using <span "
"class=\"txt-bold\">Objective-C</span> and <span class=\"txt-bold\">Cocos 2D</"
"span>."
msgstr ""
"Colaboré en el desarrollo de videojuegos para iOS usando <span class=\"txt-"
"bold\">Objective-C</span> y <span class=\"txt-bold\">Cocos 2D</span>."

#: .\www\outils\content\cv.py:123
msgid "In charge of the computerization of the institution."
msgstr "A cargo de la computarización de la institución."

#: .\www\outils\content\cv.py:124
msgid ""
"Built a desktop application to help manage the library of the institution "
"with <span class=\"txt-bold\">.NET (C#)</span> and <span class=\"txt-"
"bold\">MySQL</span>."
msgstr ""
"Desarrollé una aplicación de escritorio para ayudar a gestionar la "
"biblioteca de la institución con <span class=\"txt-bold\">.NET (C#)</span> y "
"<span class=\"txt-bold\">MySQL</span>."

#: .\www\outils\content\cv.py:127
msgid ""
"Contributed to the development of a desktop application to monitor "
"UDGLive@edu accounts using <span class=\"txt-bold\">.NET (C#)</span> and "
"<span class=\"txt-bold\">Oracle</span>."
msgstr ""
"Contribuí al desarrollo de una aplicación de escritorio para monitorear "
"cuentas UDGLive@edu usando <span class=\"txt-bold\">.NET (C#)</span> y <span "
"class=\"txt-bold\">Oracle</span>."

